WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Write the reply waits for Read the request.
Reading also waits for writing. The sorter finds a loop.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Reading does not require a written reply.
Clear B's prerequisite and sort again.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
B can start now. One valid order is
Read the request, then Write the reply.
